Propellerhead Remote Mapping File
File Format Version	1.0.0
Control Surface Manufacturer	Akai
Control Surface Model	MPK Mini Play
Map Version	1.0.0


//======================================================================
//  Malstrom Graintable Synthesizer
//
//  Pads      -> reserved (filter/osc envelope templates below)
//  Knobs 1-4A-> filter A/B section          (CC21-24)
//  Knobs 1-4B-> modulators & motion         (CC25-28)
//  Joystick X-> Pitch Bend
//  Joystick Y-> Mod Wheel
//  Keyboard  -> Keyboard
//======================================================================

Scope	Propellerheads	Malstrom Graintable Synthesizer
// Define Group	Keyboard Shortcut Variations	OscA	OscB
//	Control Surface Item	Key	Remotable Item	Scale	Mode

Map	_Scope		"Malstrom"
Map	Keyboard		Keyboard

// --- Pads (reserved) ---------------------------------
// Malstrom has no drum pads; ready-to-enable templates:
// Map Pad 1		Select Previous Patch
// Map Pad 2		Select Next Patch
// Map Pad 3		Filter Env Attack
// Map Pad 4		Filter Env Decay
// Map Pad 5		Filter Env Sustain
// Map Pad 6		Filter Env Release

// --- Knob Bank A (CC21-24): filter section -----------
Map	Knob 1 A		Filter A Freq
Map	Knob 2 A		Filter A Resonance
Map	Knob 3 A		Filter B Freq
Map	Knob 4 A		Filter B Resonance

// --- Knob Bank B (CC25-28): modulators & motion ------
Map	Knob 1 B		Modulator A Rate
Map	Knob 2 B		Modulator B Rate
Map	Knob 3 B		Oscillator A Motion
Map	Knob 4 B		Oscillator B Motion

// --- Joystick / wheels ------------------------------
Map	Joystick X		Pitch Bend
Map	Joystick Y		Mod Wheel